    // blocking on fixing all of them at once.
    // #743's mechanical sweep fixed 47 errors across 29 files, removing those 29
    // mechanical-only entries (131 -> 102, 324 -> 277 errors).
    // #802 fixed the tests/integration/full-level/*.ts cluster: helpers.ts's
    // shared GameContext fixture was missing required fields (TS2739), which
    // cascaded through every sibling importing it; level1-win.integration.test.ts
    // had its own TS2339, and tutorial.integration.test.ts an unused-import
    // TS6133. All 3 are fixed and all 16 entries (helpers.ts + 15 siblings) are
