    // #838 fixed ./unit/mining/BlastCalc.test.ts (48 -> 47 entries). 22 errors:
    // 8 TS2305 missing-export imports (calculateFragmentation,
    // calculateFragmentCount, calculateInitialVelocity, classifyProjection,
    // calculateFreeFace, propagateEnergy, identifyFragmentedVoxels,
    // PropagationResult) for symbols a past refactor renamed or moved -- their
